# The completeness track's second entry, over the artifact that needed it.
#
# The relation-absorbing variant's emitted prover has no external grader:
# the absorbed anchor projection changes the transcript upstream
# implementations do not produce, so its acceptance evidence cannot come
# from grading against them. `zkc.completeness.fri` is admitted because
# this consumer exists, not to make the completeness set look complete —
# the other declared completeness rules keep waiting for consumers of
# their own.
#
# The family input is frigrind with a real contract anchor and one
# absorbing preamble entry. The preamble adds a seal-stage binding ahead
# of the protocol and leaves the FRI reduction contract untouched, which
# is what lets the registry's contract-pinned bindings apply to an
# absorbing artifact at all.

# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: zkc-family %S/Inputs/frigrind-bound.json --emit-vocabulary=%t/vocab.json --emit-spine=%t/spine.mlir
# RUN: zkc-seal %t/spine.mlir --protocol-vocabulary=%t/vocab.json \
# RUN:   --construction-profile-registry=%zkc-registry-dir/construction-profiles.json \
# RUN:   -o %t/sealed.artifacts > /dev/null
# RUN: %python %S/../SemanticClosure/lib/artifact_handoff.py stage %t/sealed.artifacts %t/sealed.mlirbc

# Perfect completeness of the FRI commit/query phases: the honest
# prover's acceptance-failure bound is 0, and the judgment carries no
# qualitative obligations — every check the contract adds is an identity
# for honestly committed data.
# RUN: zkc-derive --signature=%zkc-registry-dir/soundness-signature.json \
# RUN:   --protocol-vocabulary=%t/vocab.json \
# RUN:   --construction-profile-registry=%zkc-registry-dir/construction-profiles.json \
# RUN:   --request=%S/Inputs/fri-bound-completeness-request.json -o=%t/witness.json %t/sealed.mlirbc
# RUN: FileCheck %s < %t/witness.json
# CHECK-DAG: "notion": "completeness"
# CHECK-DAG: "qualitative_obligations": []
# CHECK-DAG: "constant": "0"

# The soundness rules bind the same artifact through the same pinned
# contract: absorbing a relation identity must not orphan an artifact
# from the analysis that prices it.
# RUN: %python %S/../Evidence/Inputs/retarget_request.py \
# RUN:   %S/Inputs/fri-johnson-request.json %t/sealed.artifacts %t/johnson-request.json
# RUN: zkc-derive --signature=%zkc-registry-dir/soundness-signature.json \
# RUN:   --protocol-vocabulary=%t/vocab.json \
# RUN:   --construction-profile-registry=%zkc-registry-dir/construction-profiles.json \
# RUN:   --request=%t/johnson-request.json -o=%t/johnson.json %t/sealed.mlirbc
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=JOHNSON < %t/johnson.json
# JOHNSON: "notion": "round_by_round"
